WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.800
I-I call it pure evil.

00:00:01.840 --> 00:00:04.500
So they've taken away his freedom of speech,

00:00:04.540 --> 00:00:07.640
and now they've taken away his freedom of movement.

00:00:07.680 --> 00:00:10.340
I mean, they had more allowances

00:00:10.380 --> 00:00:12.080
for Khalid Sheikh Mohammed.

00:00:12.120 --> 00:00:14.380
Oh, okay.

00:00:14.420 --> 00:00:16.080
That sounds wild.

00:00:16.120 --> 00:00:18.459
But I think Jesse Watters is a reasonable man,

00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:21.219
because I was kicked in the head by a horse last week.

00:00:21.260 --> 00:00:23.219
So...

00:00:23.260 --> 00:00:24.500
let's hear him out.

00:00:24.520 --> 00:00:26.360
How is Trump being treated

00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:29.059
worse than the mastermind of 9-11?

00:00:29.059 --> 00:00:31.660
A guy needs exercise. He's usually golfing.

00:00:31.700 --> 00:00:34.000
And so you're gonna put a man who's almost 80

00:00:34.020 --> 00:00:36.959
sitting in a room like this on his butt for all that time?

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:38.700
It's not healthy. He needs sunlight.

00:00:38.740 --> 00:00:40.939
And he needs activity. He needs to be walking around.

00:00:40.959 --> 00:00:42.139
He needs action.

00:00:42.160 --> 00:00:44.099
It's really cruel and unusual puni...

00:00:44.139 --> 00:00:46.279
punishment to make a man do that.

00:00:46.299 --> 00:00:48.139
Are-are we talking about Donald Trump

00:00:48.180 --> 00:00:50.540
or an old English sheepdog?

00:00:50.580 --> 00:00:52.419
You can't keep him cooped up all day.

00:00:52.439 --> 00:00:55.439
He needs time outside, or he'll pee on the couch.

